<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine monthly vegoil/subproduct shipments.</title>
<headline>Argentine monthly vegoil/subproduct shipments.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine Agriculture</p>
<p>Secretariat March subproduct shipment figures, followed by</p>
<p>January to March totals, in tonnes, (year-earlier in</p>
<p>brackets):</p>
<p> Soymeal plts    200,698  (384,862)  1,159,233  (1,716,326)</p>
<p> Sunseed plts    274,904  (215,753)    478,657    (410,101)</p>
<p> Cotton plts	 8,198    (7,000)	8,198     (14,670)</p>
<p> Linseed expls     6,994   (19,977)     21,920     (41,076)</p>
<p> Groundnut plts    3,526    (3,000)     19,265     (12,389)</p>
<p> Other plt/expl   78,571   (12,256)    138,022     (38,496)</p>
<p> Soybean oil     129,232   (97,559)    389,783    (348,396)</p>
<p>    Sunoil	 119,441   (101,383)   255,474    (202,823)</p>
<p>Principal destinations in March were as follows (tonnes):</p>
<p>SOYPELLETS: Italy 54,306; Belgium 33,583; Spain 26,150;</p>
<p>France 24,300; Cuba 23,249; Holland 10,656</p>
<p>SUNPELLETS: Holland 154,278; Britain 43,018; Spain 27,307;</p>
<p>Denmark 18,391; Italy 16,640; France 7,009</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
